35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The transport receipts are alarming. Thirty-eight percent of the budget vanished into travel. We cannot afford another distant destination without a strict cap.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The canteen is closed. Last year, cooking duty stole two hours daily. We need a venue with staff. @Ryuji, that transport cost is a hard limit.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The seniors confirm mixing only happens when we share a building. Attendance shows a fifth never came, mostly gone by winter. We need a location that keeps everyone present.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The rate sheet shows 1,100 yen per night, including equipment. That is affordable. I need to know if the beds are actually comfortable for rest.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The whole-building terms are worse. Deposits are non-refundable, so if someone quits, we split the cost. We need a clear policy on late withdrawals before booking.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, agreed. Staffed meals are essential. @Asuka, non-refundable deposits are unacceptable given our current deficit. We must avoid that risk entirely.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minako, a third of us need overnight beds. @Asuka, non-refundable deposits are a trap. We need a venue that solves both logistics and cost.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, a third is a significant number. @Asuka, I agree on the deposit risk. We need a venue that guarantees presence without financial penalty.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Toshio, the 1,100 yen rate includes equipment, which helps. But I worry about sleep quality. Can we verify the bed conditions before committing?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, comfort is secondary to financial exposure. @Ryuji, we must avoid whole-building lets. The prefecture rate is safer, but we need a withdrawal policy.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, agreed. We must avoid non-refundable deposits. @Jonathan, verify the bed conditions. If sleep is poor, attendance drops, and costs rise. We need certainty.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Jonathan, comfort is vital for training. @Ryuji, the transport cap is absolute. We need a venue that minimizes travel and maximizes rest.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Ryuji, agreed. @Jonathan, comfort matters, but proximity is key. If we stay close, travel costs drop and attendance rises. We need a nearby venue.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, proximity helps, but rest is the foundation. If we sleep poorly, the training fails. I need to know if the public beds are actually comfortable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, comfort is subjective. The 1,100 yen rate is fixed. We must prioritize the financial safety of the group over individual preferences.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Jonathan, verify the beds. If sleep fails, training fails. @Asuka, the 1,100 yen rate is our ceiling. We need a destination that fits this budget strictly.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, agreed. The 1,100 yen rate is our ceiling. We need a destination that fits this budget strictly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Ryuji, agreed. @Jonathan, comfort is vital, but proximity is key. If we stay close, travel costs drop and attendance rises. We need a nearby venue.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Asuka, I hear your concern. But if half the group sleeps badly, the camp fails. I will accept the 1,100 yen rate if the beds are decent.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, acceptable. @Ryuji, the flat rate hides individual spending. We must define how side costs are handled to ensure fairness before voting.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
