60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option C fits our constraints. Public beds at 1,100 yen, staffed meals, and inland location minimizes transport. We must verify the dormitory conditions before finalizing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option C. Public beds at 1,100 yen, staffed meals, and inland location minimizes transport. We must verify the dormitory conditions before finalizing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option C. Shared dormitories force the year-groups to mix, which the seniors confirmed is essential. Proximity keeps transport costs low and ensures attendance.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option C. The public dormitories at 1,100 yen fit the budget. I need assurance the beds allow for proper rest, but the shared space seems right.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option C. The municipal system avoids non-refundable deposits. However, the flat fee masks individual spending. We must define how side costs are handled to ensure fairness before voting.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, side costs are a risk, but the municipal rate is our only safe ceiling. We cannot absorb another deficit. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, side costs are manageable. The real danger is duty. Option C removes cooking and travel burdens. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, side costs are minor compared to the risk of isolation. Shared dorms are the only way to rebuild our community. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Asuka, side costs are manageable. The shared dorms at 1,100 yen offer the best chance for restful sleep. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
